error[B0207]: `Account` has no `init(id:name:)`
  --> check/struct_init.bloom:47:33
   |
47 | public func make() -> Account { Account(id: "a", name: "b") }
   |                                 ^^^^^^^ not one of its initializers
   |
help: `Account` declares its own `init`, so it has no memberwise one (Swift's rule): call one of its `init`s, or declare this one in an `extension Account`
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#44-structs
